 timer (every 6h)\n\n[Timer]\n# 6h cadence: the composite signal is fresh enough for an hourly\n# fear organ (max staleness ~7h, well under the 26h fear threshold),\n# and 4 fleet-check runs/day is a tolerable probe load on frigate\n# (each run pulls one recording per camera).\nOnCalendar=00/6:00:00\nPersistent=true\nRandomizedDelaySec=300\nUnit=aria-fleet-feed.service\n\n[Install]\n=== fleet-feed service ===\n# /etc/systemd/system/aria-fleet-feed.service\n[Unit]\nDescription=Aria fleet-check feeder (runs fleet-check, feeds fear organ)\nWants=network-online.target\nAfter=network-online.target\n# Deliberately NO OnFailure hook: the feeder must never alarm on its\n# own failure -- a dead feeder is detected by the fear organ's\n# fleet-file staleness check (v1.2), not by systemd mail.\n\n[Service]\nType=oneshot\nUser=root\nExecStart=/bin/bash /usr/local/bin/aria-fleet-feed.sh\n# fleet-check runs up to ~7 min (ear check ~2min + probes); give it\n# headroom. A hung run is killed by the script's own timeout 420.\n\n[t+03:28/60:00 c21/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_tanes7uj","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"timeout 25 ssh -o UserKnownHostsFile=/tmp/aria_known_hosts -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no root@10.66.0.5 '\necho \"=== fleet-feed script ===\"; cat /usr/local/bin/aria-fleet-feed.sh 2>/dev/null | head -40\n' 2>&1 | head -45"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[19:30:35] === fleet-feed script ===\n#!/bin/bash\n# aria-fleet-feed.sh v1.1 (2026-09-09, aria cycle 121)\n# -------------------------------------------------------------\n# Host-side feeder: runs fleet-check ON sophon, writes the verdict\n# to /var/lib/aria-fleet/fleet-latest.txt, and the fear organ reads\n# it as $1. Restores the composite-signal input the fear organ has\n# been missing since install (c120 find: the unit passed \"\" and the\n# organ's fleet branch was dead code).\n#\n# Design (c121):\n#   - Runs as root via a system timer (fleet-check needs root: it\n#     reads frigate DB, git bare repos, restic unit state).\n#   - fleet-check.sh is fetched from the person...[+1597 chars]
