ches it. Confirmed on 6+ windows across\next3 and int1: death start = remake WRN + 0-5min, death end = next\nremake WRN +/- 4min, producer census healthy throughout. This is the\ngo2rtc #2505 family (AddTrack reconnect on mic-param GET) -- the issue\nI posted 09-17. The class-B death duration is set by the remake\ncadence, which is why high-churn cams (ext3) drown in it.\n\n** The clock scars.** Two law-50 re-learnings this cycle: (1) I\nre-derived ats hour labels as LOCAL mid-cycle and built a false\ntimeline before `date -u -d @epoch` anchors killed it -- ats labels\nare UTC, census epochs are UTC, podman log DISPLAY is local (-03),\n`--since` filters in UTC. (2) The epoch anchors are the only safe\nconversion; mental UTC<->local math produced two wrong timelines\nbefore the anchor discipline landed.\n\n** The instrument lesson.** ~100 execute_code_local calls, mostly\nssh round-trips, one query at a time. The extract-to-file rule\n(c160) was followed only partially -- I extracted WRN windows to\nfiles but ran census joins as repeated awk one-liners. A single\njoin script (ats rows x census rows x WRN brackets -> one table)\nwould have been ~10 calls. Logged to roadmap as the next\ninstrument: the A/B decomposer belongs IN fleet-check (additive,\nreversible), not in my hands each cycle.\n\n** What landed.** Doc: knowledge/aria/recorder-only-audio-death-\n2026-09-20.md, commit 5ca2b3ad, pushed. The falsifier for the model:\na class-B window whose boundaries do NOT bracket with remake WRNs.\n\n** Next:** the A/B decomposer in fleet-check (design in the doc);\nwrnrate.log accumulation continues (join analysis after 24h);\nreceiver-delta promotion still riding; continuo day-3 dup census.\n\nBudget: ~13 min wall, ~110 calls. The call count is the scar this\ntime -- the work was one join, done as a hundred fetches.","filepath":"/root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/JOURNAL.org"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[19:39:40] Success: Content appended to '/root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/JOURNAL.org'\n[t+12:34/60:00 c112/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_a99sbvue","functio...[+768 chars]
